## What is the problem

When I first encountered the task, I immediately found the disconnected branding from the booking site and the official site. It was mainly caused by using third-party software. 

![](/images/experience/bowtie-jp-health/image-1.webp)

![](/images/experience/bowtie-jp-health/image-2.webp)

Therefore, I focus on making the experience more human and premium by improving the consistency with brand, copy-writing and user progression.

![](/images/experience/bowtie-jp-health/image-3.webp)

[youtu.be/xelvpnC-hPI](https://youtu.be/xelvpnC-hPI?si=ZMAgXrIvraFuFqbK)

**Phase 1 and 2**

After identifying the problem, I started redesign the UIUX first with better guidance, reduce redundant information.

![](/images/experience/bowtie-jp-health/image-4.webp)

**Phase 3** 

Extra exploration. We need to tackle user behaviour through social media, where they have to input the credentials all over again.

![](/images/experience/bowtie-jp-health/image-5.webp)

## Video Demo

Desktop version - When login required

Final decision. We keep the login workflow as we have to validate if they are real people or spam.

